or that action.\",\"start\":149},{\"end\":114,\"field\":\"actor\",\"fragment_id\":\"urn:rkaf:fragment:urn%3Arulespec%3Adocument-understanding%3Adocument%3A0c61a50e5689400a9508156758910cf258b73866d6dbe1c0e05fe60a6431f452:72:114:sha256-6ae72880e7b9ecfd0e3fca93f4108a353abe13eb069f571e5b0b803bccb5bbb2\",\"quote\":\"the attorney general of the State involved\",\"start\":72},{\"end\":120,\"field\":\"modality\",\"fragment_id\":\"urn:rkaf:fragment:urn%3Arulespec%3Adocument-understanding%3Adocument%3A0c61a50e5689400a9508156758910cf258b73866d6dbe1c0e05fe60a6431f452:115:120:sha256-56ee5b508706bf2de91712d85d6d1e11ddbff01949142ed6e8c22e3b1bed1c71\",\"quote\":\"shall\",\"start\":115},{\"end\":26,\"field\":\"scope_text:0\",\"fragment_id\":\"urn:rkaf:fragment:urn%3Arulespec%3Adocument-understanding%3Adocument%3A0c61a50e5689400a9508156758910cf258b73866d6dbe1c0e05fe60a6431f452:12:26:sha256-ca9693d7a03c9f0992c78cc6587bb92ef32954c0803056e0a7056d093f04556c\",\"quote\":\"(A) In general\",\"start\":12},{\"end\":147,\"field\":\"scope_text:0\",\"fragment_id\":\"urn:rkaf:fragment:urn%3Arulespec%3Adocument-understanding%3Adocument%3A0c61a50e5689400a9508156758910cf258b73866d6dbe1c0e05fe60a6431f452:27:147:sha256-3177afe66bf3f4c757216b63469f69ad94a050ed4dec7d6c2ef477023d60ad1b\",\"quote\":\"Before filing an action under paragraph (1), the attorney general of the State involved shall provide to the Commission—\",\"start\":27}],\"id\":\"urn:rulespec:document-understanding:revision:333feec24476113d85ed8678980de92f88ff6565fdb76652f29e82e71133ddf9\",\"jurisdiction\":\"\",\"jurisdiction_quote\":\"\",\"kind\":\"requirement\",\"logic_text\":\"\",\"meaning_assertion_id\":\"urn:rulespec:document-understanding:assertion:694d8e4acc67da52db58b148e17fab968c65c54144b5d27dba6c6ae1d5c52a73\",\"modality\":\"must\",\"modality_quote\":\"shall\",\"object\":\"\",\"occurrence_id\":\"urn:rulespec:document-understanding:occurrence:29404e1ac609b02f3d2a897787a2c05e0f452928a69e2d727fc2a7f1f170332d\",\"origin\":\"aiSuggested\",\"quote\":\"(A) In general Before filing an action under paragraph (1), the attorney general of the State involved shall provide to the Commission—\\n\\n(i) written notice of that action; and\\n\\n(ii) a copy of the complaint for that action.\",\"references\":[\"paragraph (1)\"],\"relation\":\"none\",\"rule_id\":\"urn:rulespec:document-understanding:rule:4b08892dea69694b936b78e68fe50d37dd095bd88c9315d75cb7edc571641b7a\",\"scope_quotes\":[\"(A) In general Before filing an action under paragraph (1), the attorney general of the State involved shall provide to the Commission—\"],\"scope_text\":\"Before filing an action under paragraph (1)\",\"section_id\":\"section-1\",\"start\":12,\"summary\":\"Before filing an action under paragraph (1), the attorney general of the State involved must provide to the Commission written notice of that action and a copy of the complaint for that action, unless an exemption applies.\",\"target_ids\":[],\"term_refs\":[],\"typed_values\":[]}",
